message: "If you use this software or the research notes in docs/research, please cite it as below."
title: "Release Gate for Moodle (local_releasegate)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Kumar"
    given-names: "Hemant"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  A Moodle local plugin that checks whether a course is configured correctly
  before go-live, using deterministic rules over course configuration, with
  access control and audit built on Moodle's own roles, Report Builder and
  events. Alpha: not yet run on a Moodle site.
keywords:
  - moodle
  - lms
  - quality-assurance
  - compliance
  - report-builder
